# Mathilda, Swift Plume

> Mathilda is not a fighter who happens to support. She is a delivery system dressed as a hero, built to move other people where they need to be and then punish whoever they land on. Get the order of operations right and she is one of the most disruptive roamers in the game; get it wrong and she is a very fast hero with nothing useful to do.

