## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-08-18. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Favor Tempo (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Enchanted Talisman, Fleeting Time, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Enchanted Talisman, Fleeting Time
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy draft is mostly physical contact damage and has limited chain crowd control.; Dominance Ice over Oracle when Use when sustain fighters, attack-speed marksmen, or shield-heavy divers are the main problem.; Winter Crown over Immortality when Use when one predictable dive combo can be stalled after Guiding Wind or Circling Eagle has already started.
- Total cost: 10650 gold

Default ranked roam setup that turns Mathilda into a repeat engage and rescue tool with Favor, Flask, mana sustain, ultimate resets, and late revive insurance.

### Roam Anti-Sustain Defense (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Flask of the Oasis, Enchanted Talisman, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Flask of the Oasis, Dominance Ice, Oracle
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Purify
- Blessing: Favor
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when physical basic attacks and repeated contact matter more than crowd control duration.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use against single-cycle magic burst that can remove Mathilda before Guiding Wind creates a save path.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against sustained magic poke or burn that chips Mathilda before Lord and Turtle fights.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use when physical skill burst from fighters or assassins is forcing defensive ultimates too early.
- Total cost: 10610 gold

Defensive roam setup for brawl-heavy drafts where Purify protects Mathilda from CC chains and Dominance Ice punishes enemies who dive through her shield field.

### Roam Dire Hit Burst (Roam)

