- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Agility, Wilderness Blessing, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Execute
- Blessing: Dire Hit
- Flex: Tough Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when crowd control or magic burst matters more than early penetration.; Genius Wand over Ice Queen Wand when Use when your team has multiple magic damage dealers who can benefit from reduced enemy Magic Defense.; Holy Crystal over Blood Wings when Use when Mathilda is snowballing and needs maximum shield and Soul Bloom scaling instead of a personal safety shield.; Immortality over Blood Wings when Use when late death timers matter more than extra magic power and movement speed.
- Total cost: 10920 gold

Damage roam setup for pickoff drafts. Mathilda charges Ancestral Guidance and Dire Hit Force off the same constant movement, so the enhanced Basic Attack carries the stack dump into Circling Eagle, Soul Bloom, and Execute.

